# 🛒 Retail Sales Performance Dashboard

## Project Overview
Analysis of 500,000+ retail transactions from a UK-based online retailer (2010–2011).
Goal: Identify top-performing products, regions, and sales trends using Excel, SQL, and Power BI.

## Tools Used
- Excel — data cleaning and exploration
- SQL — querying and aggregating the dataset
- Power BI — interactive dashboard

## Key Questions Answered
- Which countries generate the most revenue?
- Which products are top sellers by volume and value?
- How do monthly sales trend over the year?
- What is the average order value?

